<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea Shipping - Steel scrap cargoes - July 17.</title>
<headline>S.Korea Shipping - Steel scrap cargoes - July 17.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
